# BRAVADO: B drops a bomb at Dice's feet (one a fight to start with). It
# goes off 2.5 s later and kills every monster in the blast outright: a
# brute with all its health, a gasbag without splitting it. It hurts Dice
# too, all of her, head included.
game bravado
wait 5
cheat run 1
cheat empty
cheat nopools
cheat still 0 160 70
cheat still 2 185 90
cheat still 1 160 115
cheat still 0 160 40
expect foes == 4
press B
expect bombs_out == 1
expect p1_bombs == 0
# no more to drop
press B
expect bombs_out == 1
hold LEFT 60
wait 100
expect bombs_out == 0
expect foes == 1
expect foes_1 == 0
expect foes_2 == 0
expect p1_hp == 6
# the blast takes her head too: a bomb just over it
cheat run 1
cheat empty
cheat nopools
wait 31
cheat bomb 160 54 3
wait 10
expect p1_down == 1
expect hurt_src == 300
expect state == 6
# and one at her feet
cheat run 1
cheat empty
cheat nopools
press B
wait 160
expect p1_down == 1
